==== Terminations
Episodes run the full 5.0~s (250 steps at 25~Hz). Truncation occurs on joint velocity divergence or belt collision (end-effector penetration $> 0.20 "m"$ below belt surface).

==== Curriculum
Two curriculum events are scheduled: (1)~a red distractor cube is introduced at 100,000 environment steps, testing color-selective grasping behavior; (2)~action-rate and joint-velocity regularization weights increase at 200,000 steps, encouraging smoother motions once the basic task is learned.

=== Cube Sort Task (Outlook) <subsec:cube_sort>

The cube sort task extends cube place to a multi-object scenario with eight green and eight red cubes on a moving conveyor belt. The robot must selectively pick green cubes and place them in the drum while ignoring red cubes. This task introduces object discrimination, dynamic planning, and multi-grasp sequencing. Full formulation and training results are deferred to the master thesis.
